291" end="00:09.560">I've </span><span begin="00:09.560" end="00:09.829">been </span><span begin="00:09.829" end="00:10.395">climbing </span><span begin="00:10.395" end="00:10.630">the </span><span begin="00:10.630" end="00:11.630">walls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.913" end="00:17.500"><span begin="00:11.913" end="00:12.279">And </span><span begin="00:12.279" end="00:12.562">I </span><span begin="00:12.562" end="00:12.930">just </span><span begin="00:12.930" end="00:13.229">can't </span><span begin="00:13.229" end="00:13.614">get </span><span begin="00:13.614" end="00:14.130">used </span><span begin="00:14.130" end="00:14.899">to </span><span begin="00:14.899" end="00:15.232">not </span><span begin="00:15.232" end="00:15.550">being </span><span begin="00:15.550" end="00:15.815">right </span><span begin="00:15.815" end="00:16.350">next </span><span begin="00:16.350" end="00:16.899">to </span><span begin="00:16.899" end="00:17.500">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.700" end="00:23.420"><span begin="00:17.700" end="00:18.083">Not </span><span begin="00:18.083" end="00:18.434">wearing </span><span begin="00:18.434" end="00:18.900">half </span><span begin="00:18.900" end="00:19.370">your </span><span begin="00:19.370" end="00:20.370">perfume </span><span begin="00:21.090" end="00:21.370">while </span><span begin="00:21.370" end="00:21.635">I'm </span><span begin="00:21.635" end="00:21.854">singing </span><span begin="00:21.854" end="00:22.420">your </span><span begin="00:22.420" end="00:23.420">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.790" end="00:28.809"><span begin="00:24.790" end="00:25.040">And </span><span begin="00:25.040" end="00:25.322">I </span><span begin="00:25.322" end="00:26.322">hate </span><span begin="00:26.459" end="00:26.823">that </span><span begin="00:26.823" end="00:27.141">you're </span><span begin="00:27.141" end="00:27.559">so </span><span begin="00:27.559" end="00:27.809">far </span><span begin="00:27.809" end="00:28.